ற","parts":[{"text":"தின்","lemma":"தின்","gloss":"eat"},{"text":"ற","lemma":"ற","gloss":"past relative participle suffix"}],"gloss":"that ate"},{"surface":"கயவாய்ப்","parts":[{"text":"கயம்","lemma":"கயம்","gloss":"large/deep"},{"text":"வாய்","lemma":"வாய்","gloss":"mouth"},{"text":"ப்","lemma":"ப்","gloss":"sandhi consonant"}],"gloss":"large-mouthed"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பேதை","parts":[{"text":"பேதை","lemma":"பேதை","gloss":"ignorant/young"}],"gloss":"young"},{"surface":"யானை","parts":[{"text":"யானை","lemma":"யானை","gloss":"elephant"}],"gloss":"elephant"},{"surface":"சுவைத்த","parts":[{"text":"சுவை","lemma":"சுவை","gloss":"relish/taste"},{"text":"த்த","lemma":"த்த","gloss":"past relative participle suffix"}],"gloss":"that relished"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"கூழை","parts":[{"text":"கூழை","lemma":"கூழை","gloss":"short/cropped"}],"gloss":"short"},{"surface":"மூங்கிற்","parts":[{"text":"மூங்கிற்","lemma":"மூங்கிற்","gloss":"of the bamboo"}],"gloss":"of the bamboo","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"குவட்டிடை","parts":[{"text":"குவட்டிடை","lemma":"குவட்டிடை","gloss":"on the mountain peak"}],"gloss":"on the mountain peak","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"அதுவே","parts":[{"text":"அது","lemma":"அது","gloss":"that/it"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis particle"}],"gloss":"is indeed that"}]}],"literal":"Having chased the wild beasts of the sounding forest, / the day also has ended, and the hunting dogs also are tired. / Do not go, O Lord! That nearby is our village, / on the high mountain slope, where sweet honey is torn open, / by the large-mouthed, / young elephant that relished eating the green bamboo having clusters, / it is right there on the peak of the short bamboo.","translation":"Having chased the wild beasts in the sounding forest, the day has ended and the hunting dogs are exhausted. Do not go further, O Lord! Our village is right there, on the high mountain slope where a young, large-mouthed elephant, having relished eating clusters of green bamboo, tore open sweet honeycombs; it lies right on the peak amidst the short bamboos.","modern":"ஒலிக்கும் காட்டில் காட்டு விலங்குகளைத் துரத்தி வேட்டையாடியதால், பகல் பொழுதும் முடிந்துவிட்டது; வேட்டை நாய்களும் களைப்படைந்துவிட்டன. தலைவனே! இனிமேல் செல்லாதே. இதோ அருகில் இருப்பதுதான் எங்களது ஊர். உயர்ந்த மலைச்சரிவில், கூட்டமாக உள்ள பசுமையான மூங்கில்களைத் தின்று சுவைத்த, பெரிய வாயைக் கொண்ட இளமையான யானை, இனிமையான தேன்கூட்டைக் கிழித்தெறிந்த குட்டையான மூங்கில்கள் நிறைந்த மலை உச்சிக்கு இடையேதான் எங்களது ஊர் இருக்கிறது.","explanation":"The friend of the heroine is speaking to the hero who has come to the mountain slopes for hunting. She points out that the sun has set and his hunting dogs are exhausted from chasing wild beasts, inviting him to stay at their nearby village instead of traveling back in the dark. The description of the young, large-mouthed elephant eating green bamboo and tearing open honeycombs on the high slopes reflects the rich, fertile nature of the Kuriñci (mountainous) landscape. This image also subtly implies the hero's own actions—he has come to taste the love of the heroine and should now settle down and marry her. Key words include 'கானத்து' (of the forest), 'ஞமலி' (hunting dog), 'செல்லல்' (do not go), and 'மூங்கில்' (bamboo).","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,0.7],[0.7,1.1],[1.1,1.4],[1.4,2.2],[2.2,2.2],[2.55,2.73],[2.73,3.6],[3.87,4.14],[4.14,4.69],[4.69,4.96],[4.96,5.5],[5.5,6.4],[6.41,6.5],[6.5,6.5],[6.5,6.5],[6.5,6.5],[6.5,9.4],[9.4,9.5],[9.5,10.38],[10.38,10.6],[10.6,11.0],[11.0,11.2],[11.2,12.5],[12.5,12.9],[12.9,13.2],[13.32,13.8]],"female":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,0.8],[0.8,1.2],[1.2,1.5],[1.5,2.5],[2.5,2.6],[2.98,3.16],[3.16,4.1],[4.1,5.39],[5.39,6.0],[6.0,6.1],[6.1,6.3],[6.3,7.4],[7.41,7.5],[7.5,8.3],[8.3,8.8],[8.93,9.87],[10.0,10.4],[10.4,10.6],[10.6,11.5],[11.5,11.8],[11.8,12.1],[12.1,12.3],[12.3,13.5],[13.5,14.15],[14.15,14.2],[14.36,15.0]]},"sync":[[["கல்லென்","sounding 'kal'"]],[["கானத்துக்","of the forest"]],[["கடமா","wild beasts"]],[["வாட்டி","having exhausted/chased"]],[["எல்லும்","the day also"]],[["எல்லின்று","has ended"]],[["ஞமலியும்","the dogs also"]],[["இளைத்தன","are tired"]],[["செல்லல்","do not go"]],[["ஐஇய","O Lord"]],[["உது","that nearby"],["எம்","our"]],[["ஊரே","is the village"]],[["ஓங்குவரை","high mountain"]],[["அடுக்கத்து","of the mountain slope"]],[["தீந்தேன்","sweet honey"]],[["கிழித்த","that tore open"]],[["குவையுடைப்","having clusters"]],[["பசுங்கழை","green bamboo"]],[["தின்ற","that ate"]],[["கயவாய்ப்","large-mouthed"]],[["பேதை","young"]],[["யானை","elephant"]],[["சுவைத்த","that relished"]],[["கூழை","short"]],[["மூங்கிற்","of the bamboo"]],[["குவட்டிடை","on the mountain peak"]],[["அதுவே","is indeed that"]]]}